# Guard film (the soil ramp, docs/plans/soil-ramp.md, 2026-10-24): a Matabele major walks down a burrow's floor of
# 45-degree dirt ramps, one block down for every block forward, into the room 3 down, and back up. The trench is left
# open on top so the camera sees the whole body on the slope (no part inside the ramps, no jump between them).
cmd time set noon
cmd weather clear
cmd fill -6 -63 -2 8 -61 2 dirt
cmd fill -6 -61 -2 8 -61 2 grass_block
cmd setblock 0 -61 0 colonyframework:dirt_ramp[facing=west]
cmd setblock 1 -61 0 air
cmd setblock 1 -62 0 colonyframework:dirt_ramp[facing=west]
cmd fill 2 -62 0 2 -61 0 air
cmd setblock 2 -63 0 colonyframework:dirt_ramp[facing=west]
cmd fill 3 -63 -1 5 -61 1 air
lens 30
walker matabele_major -3.5 -60 0.5 -90
log burrow
cmd tick freeze
fov 14
follow 0 2.6 -2.4 0 50
go 4 -63 0
burst burrow 110 1
go -3 -60 0
burst burrow_up 110 1
log off
follow off
quit
